----------------------------------------------------
The application is written in TypeScript/JavaScript and runs on Electron.
Production dependencies and their licenses:

- Electron 45 (MIT) and its bundled Chromium (BSD-3-Clause and additional
  third-party notices shipped with the Electron distribution).
- React 19, React DOM 19 (MIT).
- better-sqlite3 (MIT).
- proxy-chain (Apache-2.0). Apache-2.0 is compatible with GPL version 3.
- maxmind (MIT), ipaddr.js (MIT).
- yauzl (MIT), yazl (MIT).
- zod (MIT).
- Additional transitive packages are distributed under MIT, BSD-3-Clause,
  Apache-2.0 or 0BSD; all are compatible with GPL version 3. Exact versions and
  integrity values are pinned in package-lock.json.

Bundled assets and data:

- Country flag SVGs from flag-icons (MIT). Full text:
  resources/flags/LICENSE.flag-icons.txt
- IP-to-Country Lite database by DB-IP.com (CC BY 4.0). Attribution, source
  and checksums: resources/geoip/README.md. The user interface displays
  "IP geolocation data by DB-IP.com" with a link to https://db-ip.com.

